{"id": "85942", "name": "פירוק טרינום ריבועי לגורמים – (v+1)(v+n) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Fully factorize {{CT:0}}.</p>\n<p>[[input:ans1]]</p>\n<p>[[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>We want to factorize {{CT:0}}.</p>\n<p>So we need to find 2 numbers which add to {{CT:1}} and multiplies to {{CT:2}}.</p>\n<p>Since \\[ 1 + {{CT:3}} = {{CT:4}} \\quad\\mbox{ and }\\quad 1\\times {{CT:3}} = {{CT:3}}, \\] the two numbers are \\( 1 \\) and {{CT:2}}. So we can then rewrite the equation and factorize: \\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle {{CT:5}} &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:6}}^2 + {{CT:6}} + ({{CT:7}}) + {{CT:3}},\\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:8}},\\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:9}}. \\end{array}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "FacForm", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-FAC-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ALG-FAC-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["m", "n", "p",